[45.2741, "o", "Fixed the BULK discount logic: changed condition from `total > BULK_MINIMUM` to `total >= BULK_MINIMUM` and corrected calculation from `total * RATES[code]` to `total * (1 - RATES[code])`. All tests now pass.\r\n\r\n"]
